# R analysis scripts

Run scripts in numeric order. Keep each script focused and rerunnable:

1. 01-import.R reads raw data and records the input contract.
2. 02-clean.R creates analysis-ready data.
3. 03-analyze.R estimates models and writes machine-readable results.
4. 04-export.R creates tables and figures used by paper.qmd.

Put reusable functions in helpers.R. Keep exploratory work in sandbox/ until
it is stable enough to promote here.
